Z||000000||Homicidal||04-24-2000||02:03 AM||||Fiero can do anything a regular sized market car can do.  It just takes imagination and work to do stuff to a Fiero that a regular car takes easily too.  Take stereo systems for example.  Anybody can buy a Ford Explorer or Honda Civic, drop 3 10" or 12" subs, 2 amps, a crossover, equalizer, 12 cd changer, etc..<P>But it takes somebody with skills and analytical skills to do the same to a Fiero and get the same or better results.<P>Another example is engine size, but since I'm not a gearhead, I cannot explain how it's done.<P>But to take a Fiero and drop a v-8, 355 HP engine and then a kick @ss stereo system isn't just a hobby, it's a victory!<P>||||reg||6
Z||000001||Cooter||04-24-2000||06:17 PM||||Just changing spark plugs in a v6 Fiero is a victory! ||||reg||1
